 "text": "Hi, how have you been? It depends how often you ride. Ten to twenty minutes per session is what you' lose from air loss. You' pumping it up, not out. Put a bit more than needed so it stays crisp on the hill, then top up at pump at station. That loses air. Find the appropriate valve and pump with it. Keep it at or just above the low mark anyway. Rain doesn't push in straight away, it's the wind gets you.",
